This project bundles and adapts third-party MIT-licensed material:

  - The inference engine (model.go) is adapted from github.com/tmc/go-llama2,
    a pure-Go port of Andrej Karpathy's llama2.c
    (https://github.com/karpathy/llama2.c). Copyright (c) 2023 Andrej Karpathy
    and contributors. MIT License.

  - The embedded weights (assets/stories260K.bin) and tokenizer
    (assets/tok512.bin) are Andrej Karpathy's stories260K model from
    github.com/karpathy/tinyllamas. MIT License.
